---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Markdown 编辑器 - 我的工具箱" description="实时预览的 Markdown 编辑器">
  <div class="tool-wrap">
    <a class="back" href="/">← 返回首页</a>
    <h1>📝 Markdown 编辑器</h1>
    <p class="sub">左侧编辑、右侧实时预览，本地渲染（marked.js），内容不上传。</p>

    <div class="btn-row">
      <button id="btn-copy">复制 Markdown</button>
      <button id="btn-download">下载 .md</button>
      <button id="btn-clear">清空</button>
    </div>
    <div class="msg" id="msg"></div>

    <div class="md-grid">
      <textarea id="editor" placeholder="# 标题&#10;输入 Markdown…"># 欢迎使用 Markdown 编辑器

这是一个**实时预览**的编辑器。

- 支持列表
- 支持 *斜体* 与 **加粗**
- [链接](https://example.com)

```js
console.log('hello');
```
</textarea>
      <div class="md-preview" id="preview"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>

<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/github-markdown-css@5/github-markdown.min.css" is:inline />
<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/marked@12/marked.min.js" is:inline></script>

<script is:inline>
  const $ = (id) => document.getElementById(id);
  const editor = $('editor');
  const preview = $('preview');
  const msg = $('msg');
  function showMsg(t, type = 'ok') { msg.textContent = t; msg.className = 'msg ' + type; }

  function render() {
    if (!window.marked) return;
    preview.innerHTML = window.marked.parse(editor.value);
  }
  editor.addEventListener('input', render);
  // 初次渲染（等脚本加载）
  if (window.marked) render();
  else {
    const t = setInterval(() => { if (window.marked) { render(); clearInterval(t); } }, 50);
  }

  $('btn-copy').addEventListener('click', async () => {
    if (!editor.value) return;
    try { await navigator.clipboard.writeText(editor.value); showMsg('已复制 Markdown'); }
    catch { showMsg('复制失败，请手动选择'); }
  });
  $('btn-download').addEventListener('click', () => {
    if (!editor.value) return;
    const blob = new Blob([editor.value], { type: 'text/markdown' });
    const url = URL.createObjectURL(blob);
    const a = document.createElement('a');
    a.href = url; a.download = 'document.md'; a.click();
    URL.revokeObjectURL(url);
  });
  $('btn-clear').addEventListener('click', () => { editor.value = ''; render(); });
</script>

<style>
  .md-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 16px; margin-top: 12px; }
  .md-grid textarea { min-height: 420px; }
  .md-preview {
    min-height: 420px; padding: 18px; overflow: auto;
    background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 10px;
  }
  .md-preview.markdown-body { font-size: 15px; }
  @media (max-width: 720px) { .md-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
</style>
